        "content": "I go to synagogue every Shabbat and we always say the same prayers — the Kaddish, the Shema — every single time. Most of the people I talk through serious decisions with are from that same community. Do you think relying on the same tight-knit group for most of your big decisions changes how much you trust yourself when they are not around?"
